lt=\"\" width=\"1254\" height=\"1017\"></strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1608/982/quality-border-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1063\" height=\"793\"></strong></p></div><hr>",
